      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Data sources:** internal synthetic system events; external DummyJSON sample API history; simulated Kafka events persisted to PostgreSQL. Throughput, processing latency, duplicates, and failures are measured from consumer telemetry."
      }
